          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalakalusilia Babeli nende bosi abamenyanga ebuKalidayo obubii bwabwe bwosi obwa bakholela eSayuni mumonitsio, OMWAMI aboola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.58"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likhuwa elia Yeremia omunabii yalaka Seraya waNeria waMaseya, olwa yatsia eBabeli halala nende Zedekia omuruchi waYuda mumuyika kwakhane kwoburuchibwe. Ne Seraya tsana yali omusinjilili khukebiliibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia yahandiika mushitabu amabii kosi akakhakwila Babeli, mbu amakhuwa kano kosi akahandiikwa khukaBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia namusunjila Seraya mbu Olwa olaba niwoolile eBabeli, orachweya okhusooma amakhuwa kano kosi ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nosunga mbu E OMWAMI, waboola khukahabundu hano mbu wakhahaakamia, mbu omundu yesi aleshe okhumenyaho, kata omundu kata omuruko ta, ne mbu habe likunda inziayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa olaba nomalile okhusooma eshitabu shino pe, oshibohekhwo lichina, oshisukune muEufurate hakari; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "noboola mbu Nindio Babeli aleeyinikha, ne shialabuukha khandi ta, khulwa eshibii eshia ndalamukhupiakhwo. Amakhuwa kaYeremia kaakaame yaho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
